The '''Pokémon Ninja School''' (Japanese: '''忍者スクール''' ''Ninja School'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Kanto]] region. It is located between [[Lavender Town]] and [[Fuchsia City]]. [[Angela]] is one of the teachers here. There are many students here, including [[Evian]].

{{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} went to the Pokémon Ninja School in order to train themselves in {{wp|jujutsu}}. {{an|Brock}} caught a {{TP|Brock|Bonsly}} there.

It is similar to the [[Pokémon Jujitsu Academy]] in [[Johto]].
